
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>ReVesti – Gebraucht kaufen. Einfach verkaufen.</title>
  <style>
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f7f7f5;color:#222}
    header{background:white;padding:18px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5}
    .nav{max-width:1100px;margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px}
    .logo{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#111}
    nav a{margin-left:18px;text-decoration:none;color:#333;font-weight:600}
    .hero{max-width:1100px;margin:30px auto;padding:45px 25px;background:#e8efe9;border-radius:22px;text-align:center}
    .hero h1{font-size:42px;margin:0 0 15px}
    .hero p{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:25px}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:13px 22px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;margin:5px}
    .dark{background:#111;color:white}
    .light{background:white;color:#111;border:1px solid #ccc}
    section{max-width:1100px;margin:35px auto;padding:0 20px}
    h2{font-size:28px}
    .cats,.products{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:15px}
    .card{background:white;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:14px;padding:18px}
    .cat{font-weight:700;text-align:center;padding:25px 10px}
    .product-img{height:150px;background:#eee;border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:45px}
    .price{font-size:21px;font-weight:800;margin-top:10px}
    .commission{background:#111;color:white;border-radius:20px;padding:35px;text-align:center}
    footer{margin-top:50px;background:#222;color:white;text-align:center;padding:30px}
    @media(max-width:700px){
      nav{display:none}
      .hero h1{font-size:31px}
      .cats,.products{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="nav">
    <div class="logo">ReVesti</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="#">Kaufen</a>
      <a href="#">Verkaufen</a>
      <a href="#">Favoriten</a>
      <a href="#">Konto</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="hero">
  <h1>Gebraucht kaufen.<br>Einfach verkaufen.</h1>
  <p>Entdecke tolle gebrauchte Produkte oder verkaufe deine eigenen Sachen einfach und sicher.</p>
  <a class="btn dark" href="#">Kaufen</a>
  <a class="btn light" href="#">Verkaufen</a>
</div>

<section>
  <h2>Kategorien</h2>
  <div class="cats">
    <div class="card cat">👕 Kleidung</div>
    <div class="card cat">📱 Elektronik</div>
    <div class="card cat">🏠 Zuhause</div>
    <div class="card cat">🐶 Haustiere</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Neueste Angebote</h2>
  <div class="products">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="product-img">👟</div>
      <h3>Schuhe</h3>
      <div class="price">25 €</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="product-img">📱</div>
      <h3>Smartphone</h3>
      <div class="price">120 €</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="product-img">👜</div>
      <h3>Tasche</h3>
      <div class="price">35 €</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="product-img">🎮</div>
      <h3>Spielkonsole</h3>
      <div class="price">90 €</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="commission">
    <h2>Nur 10 % Provision</h2>
    <p>Du verkaufst für 50 €? ReVesti erhält 5 € Provision und du erhältst 45 €.</p>
    <a class="btn light" href="#">Jetzt verkaufen</a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <strong>ReVesti</strong>
  <p>Gebraucht kaufen. Einfach verkaufen.</p>
  <p>© 2026 ReVesti</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
